{"id": "street-artist-certificate-fees", "title": "Street artist fees rose while three inactive accounts held $173,466", "seconds": 40.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "af165b723c34876b", "words": 125, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco street artists once paid $350 for an annual certificate.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.64, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "set", "the", "price?"], "sub": "The Board raised the annual certificate price in three steps"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.79, 1.09, 1.45, 1.7, 2.03, 2.29, 2.57, 2.87, 3.25, 3.39, 3.51, 3.91]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City then raised the fee in three steps.", "t0": 4.76, "t1": 7.02, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "law", "layout": "table", "heading": "Annual certificate", "context": "Enacted fees", "rows": [{"label": "FY2003–04", "value": "$373.60"}, {"label": "FY2004–05", "value": "$396.40"}, {"label": "FY2005–06", "value": "$419.20"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.44, 0.65, 0.92, 1.05, 1.28, 1.42, 1.68]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Three inactive accounts still held more than $173,000.", "t0": 7.24, "t1": 11.48, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "balances", "kicker": "Three inactive projects still held $173,466", "text": "Inactive accounts", "mark": "Inactive"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.7, 1.13, 1.43, 1.68, 1.87, 2.07, 2.27, 2.63, 3.33, 3.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2009 the Controller combined those balances with the operating account.", "t0": 11.6, "t1": 15.77, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "balances", "kicker": "Three inactive projects still held $173,466", "text": "Consolidation", "mark": "Consolidation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.37, 0.78, 1.13, 1.26, 1.74, 2.17, 2.39, 2.96, 3.12, 3.24, 3.69]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Auditors said the old price could have lasted longer.", "t0": 15.89, "t1": 18.36, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "model", "kicker": "The modeled price eventually moved above the price artists paid", "text": "The modeled fee", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.69, 0.82, 1.05, 1.35, 1.53, 1.67, 2.06]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "By fiscal 2007, their model ran above the actual price.", "t0": 18.48, "t1": 22.65, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "model", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2006–07", "context": "Annual fee", "rows": [{"label": "Actual", "value": "$419.20"}, {"label": "Modeled", "value": "$465.70"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.61, 0.8, 1.18, 2.11, 2.38, 2.7, 2.9, 3.2, 3.33, 3.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A separate management charge lacked a time study.", "t0": 22.77, "t1": 25.13, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "cost", "kicker": "One year-end management charge lacked time records", "text": "Management charge", "mark": "Management"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.53, 0.96, 1.3, 1.59, 1.68, 1.97]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Auditors found at least $4,000 in excess overhead for the program.", "t0": 25.25, "t1": 29.12, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "cost", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2009–10", "context": "Separate charges", "rows": [{"label": "Management charge", "value": "$18,875"}, {"label": "Overhead overcharge", "value": "At least $4,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.77, 0.86, 1.12, 1.4, 1.74, 2.03, 2.12, 2.57, 2.98, 3.09, 3.2]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Arts Commission disputed the grand jury’s account of the legal costs.", "t0": 29.34, "t1": 33.08, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "jury", "kicker": "The City cut the base fee after a separate dispute over legal expenses", "text": "Agency response", "mark": "Agency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.3, 0.7, 1.2, 1.3, 1.55, 1.84, 2.27, 2.39, 2.52, 2.85]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "In 2021 the Board cut the base fee to $80 a year.", "t0": 33.2, "t1": 36.68, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Later fee change"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.48, 0.98, 1.11, 1.38, 1.59, 1.72, 2.02, 2.31, 2.46, 2.73, 3.07, 3.16]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 36.8, "t1": 39.16, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The Board raised the annual certificate price in three steps", "b": "Three inactive projects still held $173,466", "o": "The City cut the base fee after a separate dispute over legal expenses"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "timeline"}